   "reason": "BLS nonfarm business labor share index (PRS85006173), year on year: Sep 2025 -0.7%, Dec 2025 -1.3%, Mar 2026 -3.1%, Jun 2026 -3.4%. Below the normal band floor (-2%) but above the fast band (-5%). The index also fell this fast in 2021-23 after the inflation shock, so the reading is `emerging`, not a break. Initial seed.",
