 "timing_rationale": "Lagging: the labour share moves only as wages and profits adjust to productivity, and BLS revises it for years.",
 "tracker_interpretation": "The share is falling faster than a cycle alone explains, though from a post-pandemic high; it is the one adaptation series that is not at trend.",
 "unit": "share",
