 "valve_measured": "leak",
 "why_it_matters": "If AI shifts surplus from wages to capital, this is where it shows in official data. The Anthropic Institute's September 2026 scenarios put the labour share at 60% today and 45% by 2030 under extreme change, and unchanged under modest change."
